---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Wayline from '../components/Wayline.astro';
---

<Layout title="Don't Lose Your Way — You are not the only one" description="A quiet space for reflection. Not therapy. Not a fix. Just proof that others have stood where you stand.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-glow glow-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <img src="/media/hero.png" alt="Don't Lose Your Way" width="1024" height="1024" class="hero-img rise" />
      <h1 class="rise rise-1">You are not the only one.</h1>
      <p class="hero-line rise rise-2">A quiet space for reflection.</p>
      <p class="hero-line rise rise-2">Not therapy. Not a fix.</p>
      <p class="hero-line rise rise-3">Just proof that others have stood where you stand.</p>
      <p class="hero-doors rise rise-4">
        <a href="/start-here" class="door-link">Start Here</a>
        <a href="/about" class="door-link">Read the full story</a>
        <a href="/podcast" class="door-link">Listen</a>
        <a href="/chapel" class="door-link">The Chapel</a>
      </p>
      <Wayline />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Why This Matters</h2>
      <p>Don't Lose Your Way was created for the quiet moments people often face alone — moments of emotional overload, isolation, fear, grief, or inner pressure that can feel impossible to explain.</p>
      <p>This platform exists to offer a pause.</p>
      <p>Through reflections, music, podcasts, anonymous voices, and creative expression, it creates a space where someone can feel seen before they give up, shut down, or lose their way.</p>

      <h3>Emotional Reflection</h3>
      <p>A place for visitors to slow down, read, breathe, and reconnect with what they are feeling.</p>

      <h3>Creative Expression</h3>
      <p>Through the Chapel experience, feelings can be transformed into words, phrases, lyrics, or songs that give emotion a voice.</p>

      <h3>Community Voice</h3>
      <p>Anonymous reflections, shared stories, and future audio submissions help visitors understand they are not alone.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>The Beginning</h2>
      <p>I wrote a letter I hoped no one would ever have to read.</p>
      <p>I'm still here. And if you're reading this, you are too.</p>
      <p>This isn't a success story. It's a place to feel less alone.</p>
      <div class="video-wrap">
        <video controls preload="metadata" src="/video/dont-lose-your-way-captioned.mp4" aria-label="Don't Lose Your Way — a short introduction in Carlos's own voice">
          Your browser does not support the video element.
        </video>
      </div>
      <p><a href="/about">Read the full story →</a></p>
      <p>This space exists for people who almost gave up — and stayed.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>The music that came from this place</h2>
      <p><em>Healing Trauma Through AI Music</em> — the series that grew out of this space, on SoundCloud.</p>
      <div class="embed-wrap">
        <iframe title="Healing Trauma Through AI Music series on SoundCloud" width="100%" height="300" scrolling="no" frameborder="no" loading="lazy" allow="autoplay" src="https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/playlists/2334756882&color=%23cf2e4f&auto_play=false&hide_related=true&show_comments=false&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=false"></iframe>
      </div>
      <p><a href="https://soundcloud.com/carlos-cabrales-iii/sets/healing-trauma-through-ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Listen on SoundCloud →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Help This Project Reach Someone Who Needs It</h2>
      <p>Built as a digital storytelling and emotional support platform, Don't Lose Your Way welcomes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Partnerships with mental health organizations and advocacy groups</li>
        <li>Grants and funding opportunities</li>
        <li>Sponsorships from aligned organizations</li>
        <li>Community collaboration and creative contributions</li>
      </ul>
      <p>If you're in immediate distress or thinking about harming yourself, please reach out now.</p>
      <p>Call or text 988</p>
      <p>24/7 • Free • Confidential</p>
      <p><strong>Phone:</strong> 988</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .hero { position: relative; padding: 4.5rem 0 3.5rem; text-align: center; overflow: hidden; }
    /* A low rose light behind the artwork — the horizon glow in the image, extended into the page. */
    .hero-glow {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 42% at 50% 34%, rgba(207, 46, 79, 0.22), rgba(207, 46, 79, 0.06) 55%, transparent 75%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .hero-inner { position: relative; }
    .hero-img { width: 240px; height: 240px; border-radius: 28px; margin: 0 auto 2rem; display: block; box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(207, 46, 79, 0.25); }
    .hero h1 { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; }
    .hero-line { font-size: 1.1875rem; font-weight: 300; color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 0.375rem; }
    .hero-doors { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; justify-content: center; margin: 2.25rem 0 2.75rem; }
    .door-link {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px;
      padding: 0.625rem 1.25rem; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 9999px;
      color: var(--text); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9375rem;
    }
    .door-link:hover { background: var(--surface); }
    .section-alt { background: var(--surface); }
    .video-wrap { margin: 2rem 0; }
    .video-wrap video { width: 100%; max-width: 24rem; display: block; border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: #000; }
    .embed-wrap { margin: 1.5rem 0; border-radius: var(--radius-md); overflow: hidden; }
    .embed-wrap iframe { display: block; border: 0; }
  </style>
</Layout>
